{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-37","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number be measured by any number, the number which is measured will have a part called by the same name as the measuring number.","book":7,"number":37,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.37","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.37/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":37,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","contentId":"euclid-7-37","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89d298a95cdd3693a3805f8c91e6076e43681bed6a2c40525e791d08e57973aa","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-37.statement","euclid-7-37.construction.1","euclid-7-37.proof.1","euclid-7-37.proof.2","euclid-7-37.proof.3","euclid-7-37.conclusion","euclid-7-37.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-37.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-37","revisionId":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cdf6e43e0006a76761aba1fd6173056f44ccf46bfdcbb5e834edce6c5b964eb8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number be measured by any number, the number which is measured will have a part called by the same name as the measuring number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果用任何数字计量数字,则所整除的数字将有一个部分与计量数字的名称相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-37.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-37","revisionId":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9f8734198ed543c3cadab696eefeeb8e3c2d5700dfc79fa55c31aef664b618f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number A be measured by any number B; I say that A has a part called by the same name as B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A用任何B数字来整除;我说,A数字有一部分是B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-37.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-37","revisionId":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28afaee32611471734295c99ce39b7104ec0a9faf35456221efb2cc29f4c86cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, as many times as B measures A, so many units let there be in C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B 整除 A 这么多的单位 C 数倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-37.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-37","revisionId":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc366e099dd0d46d69eeea495c8c75bdb338606e69335fbab371f31d59566755","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since B measures A according to the units in C, and the unit D also measures the number C according to the units in it, therefore the unit D measures the number C the same number of times as B measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"根据C的单位和单位的D的单位和单位的C的整除,因此,单位的D和C的B是B的相同次数。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-37.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-37","revisionId":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e7ddc4214630049fe8293c680504cfdcfe3e9f7d47e33b9102eb69aa2549e58","citations":["euclid-7-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, the unit D measures the number B the same number of times as C measures A; [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)] therefore, whatever part the unit D is of the number B, the same part is C of A also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从另一个角度讲,数字B的单位 D 整除乘以C 整除 A;因此,无论数字单位 D是多少,B也是A的C。 [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-37.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-37","revisionId":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05085d82b6f9334fbb35d4e88b945bb9d0580f97ea9033aab136eb6de9938a46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit D is a part of the number B called by the same name as it; therefore C is also a part of A called by the same name as B, so that A has a part C which is called by the same name as B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但单位 D是B中与它同名号码的一部分;因此,C也是A中与B同名号码的一部分,因此,A有C同名号码,B、Q、E、D同名号码。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-37.source","contentId":"euclid-7-37","revisionId":"euclid-7-37@raw-89d298a95cdd3693","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4be5fc04faa0dbdef9560ef2d904e937dc91ea15baa32e93740bf2b9fb656f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.37/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.37\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-37:euclid-7-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-37","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-37.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.37","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.37/","sourceLabel":"VII. 15"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-39:euclid-7-37:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-39.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-37","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39/","sourceLabel":"VII. 37"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-37:euclid-7-15:explicit","id":"euclid-7-15","book":7,"number":15,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-39:euclid-7-37:explicit","id":"euclid-7-39","book":7,"number":39,"kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
